\section{Trace Drivers Across the Boundary}

The following is a connectivity and settled-value check, not an event-scheduling algorithm. With known inputs, evaluate each edge of \Cref{fig:visual-304} and compare the internal net with the module boundary.

\begin{verbatim}
select mix4 as the root
link u_mask.masked to kept       # one driver for the parent net
drive a=1010, mask=1100, b=0011
after settling:
    expect kept == 1000          # AND belongs to the child
    expect y    == 1011          # XOR belongs to the parent
change only b to 0000
after settling:
    expect kept == 1000          # no dependence on b
    expect y    == 1000
\end{verbatim}

